{
  "version": "Notebook/1.0",
  "isLocked": false,
  "fallbackResourceIds": [
    "__MODEL_ACCOUNT_RESOURCE_ID__"
  ],
  "items": [
    {
      "type": 1,
      "name": "intro",
      "content": {
        "json": "## Foundry Model Fleet & Usage\nCompare **subscription and underlying model** totals across the accounts selected in **Compare accounts**. Models are identified by the reported `ModelName`, not deployment aliases; versions with the same model name are combined. Blank values mean no reported samples, not zero usage. Token counts are **not billed cost**."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": 9,
      "name": "parameters",
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
        "crossComponentResources": [
          "value::selected"
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "id": "Subscriptions",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "Subscriptions",
            "type": 6,
            "label": "Subscriptions",
            "isRequired": true,
            "multiSelect": true,
            "quote": "'",
            "delimiter": ",",
            "value": [
              "/subscriptions/__MODEL_ACCOUNT_SUBSCRIPTION_ID__"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "FoundryResources",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "FoundryResources",
            "type": 5,
            "label": "Compare accounts",
            "isRequired": true,
            "multiSelect": true,
            "quote": "'",
            "delimiter": ",",
            "query": "resources | where subscriptionId in~ ({Subscriptions}) or strcat('/subscriptions/', subscriptionId) in~ ({Subscriptions}) | where type =~ 'microsoft.cognitiveservices/accounts' and kind in~ ('AIServices', 'OpenAI') | project value=id, label=strcat(name, ' (', resourceGroup, ')'), selected=id =~ '__MODEL_ACCOUNT_RESOURCE_ID__', group=subscriptionId",
            "crossComponentResources": [
              "{Subscriptions}"
            ],
            "queryType": 1,
            "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources",
            "typeSettings": {
              "additionalResourceOptions": []
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "FoundryResource",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "FoundryResource",
            "type": 5,
            "label": "Detail account",
            "isRequired": true,
            "query": "resources | where subscriptionId in~ ({Subscriptions}) or strcat('/subscriptions/', subscriptionId) in~ ({Subscriptions}) | where type =~ 'microsoft.cognitiveservices/accounts' and kind in~ ('AIServices', 'OpenAI') | where id in~ ({FoundryResources}) | project value=id, label=strcat(name, ' (', resourceGroup, ')'), selected=id =~ '__MODEL_ACCOUNT_RESOURCE_ID__'",
            "crossComponentResources": [
              "{Subscriptions}"
            ],
            "queryType": 1,
            "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources",
            "typeSettings": {
              "additionalResourceOptions": []
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "fleet-time",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "TimeRange",
            "type": 4,
            "isRequired": true,
            "value": {
              "durationMs": 604800000
            },
            "typeSettings": {
              "selectableValues": [
                {
                  "durationMs": 3600000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 86400000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 604800000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 2592000000
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ],
        "style": "pills",
        "queryType": 1,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "name": "scope-notes",
      "content": {
        "json": "### Subscription comparison and account drilldown\nSelect subscriptions, then all accounts you want included in **Compare accounts**. The totals table sums selected accounts/deployments by full subscription resource ID and underlying `ModelName`. Expand a model row to inspect its contributing accounts. Trends remain separate account/deployment series, **not subscription/model rollups**.\n\nOnly RBAC-accessible resources are discoverable; selecting a subscription does not automatically include every account. Project inventory is metadata: usage belongs to parent accounts/deployments and is **not project-attributed**."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": 3,
      "name": "account-inventory",
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
        "query": "resources | where subscriptionId in~ ({Subscriptions}) or strcat('/subscriptions/', subscriptionId) in~ ({Subscriptions}) | where type =~ 'microsoft.cognitiveservices/accounts' and kind in~ ('AIServices', 'OpenAI') | where id in~ ({FoundryResources}) | project Account=name, ResourceGroup=resourceGroup, Subscription=subscriptionId, Region=location, Kind=kind, AccountResourceId=id",
        "queryType": 1,
        "size": 0,
        "visualization": "grid",
        "crossComponentResources": [
          "{Subscriptions}"
        ],
        "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": 3,
      "name": "project-inventory",
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
        "query": "resources | where subscriptionId in~ ({Subscriptions}) or strcat('/subscriptions/', subscriptionId) in~ ({Subscriptions}) | where type =~ 'microsoft.cognitiveservices/accounts/projects' | extend AccountResourceId=tostring(split(tolower(id), '/projects/')[0]) | where AccountResourceId in~ ({FoundryResources}) | project Project=name, ResourceGroup=resourceGroup, Subscription=subscriptionId, AccountResourceId, ProjectResourceId=id",
        "queryType": 1,
        "size": 0,
        "visualization": "grid",
        "noDataMessage": "No accessible Foundry projects for the selected accounts.",
        "crossComponentResources": [
          "{Subscriptions}"
        ],
        "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "name": "model-totals-label",
      "content": {
        "json": "### Combined subscription/model totals\nInput/output/total-token and request totals for the selected range. Subscription IDs are grouping keys, so identically named models in different subscriptions stay separate. Subscriptions also show an all-model subtotal. Blank cells remain unavailable, not measured zero. Grouped trend columns are intentionally disabled to preserve missing-versus-zero semantics."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": 10,
      "name": "subscription-model-totals",
      "content": {
        "chartId": "model-fleet-subscription-model-totals",
        "version": "MetricsItem/2.0",
        "size": 0,
        "chartType": 0,
        "gridFormatType": 2,
        "resourceLimit": 10000,
        "showExpandCollapseGrid": true,
        "resourceIds": [
          "{FoundryResources}"
        ],
        "resourceType": "microsoft.cognitiveservices/accounts",
        "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
        "metrics": [
          {
            "namespace": "microsoft.cognitiveservices/accounts",
            "metric": "microsoft.cognitiveservices/accounts--InputTokens",
            "aggregation": 1,
            "splitBy": [
              "ModelName"
            ],
            "splitByLimit": 1000
          },
          {
            "namespace": "microsoft.cognitiveservices/accounts",
            "metric": "microsoft.cognitiveservices/accounts--OutputTokens",
            "aggregation": 1,
            "splitBy": [
              "ModelName"
            ],
            "splitByLimit": 1000
          },
          {
            "namespace": "microsoft.cognitiveservices/accounts",
            "metric": "microsoft.cognitiveservices/accounts--TotalTokens",
            "aggregation": 1,
            "splitBy": [
              "ModelName"
            ],
            "splitByLimit": 1000
          },
          {
            "namespace": "microsoft.cognitiveservices/accounts",
            "metric": "microsoft.cognitiveservices/accounts--ModelRequests",
            "aggregation": 1,
            "splitBy": [
              "ModelName"
            ],
            "splitByLimit": 1000
          }
        ],
        "gridSettings": {
          "hierarchySettings": {
            "treeType": 1,
            "groupBy": [
              "Subscription",
              "Segment"
            ],
            "expandTopLevel": true,
            "finalBy": "Name"
          },
          "formatters": [
            {
              "columnMatch": "Name",
              "formatter": 5
            },
            {
              "columnMatch": "Segment",
              "formatter": 5
            },
            {
              "columnMatch": "microsoft.cognitiveservices/accounts--InputTokens",
              "formatter": 1,
              "formatOptions": {
                "aggregation": "Sum"
              }
            },
            {
              "columnMatch": "microsoft.cognitiveservices/accounts--InputTokens Timeline",
              "formatter": 5
            },
            {
              "columnMatch": "microsoft.cognitiveservices/accounts--OutputTokens",
              "formatter": 1,
              "formatOptions": {
                "aggregation": "Sum"
              }
            },
            {
              "columnMatch": "microsoft.cognitiveservices/accounts--OutputTokens Timeline",
              "formatter": 5
            },
            {
              "columnMatch": "microsoft.cognitiveservices/accounts--TotalTokens",
              "formatter": 1,
              "formatOptions": {
                "aggregation": "Sum"
              }
            },
            {
              "columnMatch": "microsoft.cognitiveservices/accounts--TotalTokens Timeline",
              "formatter": 5
            },
            {
              "columnMatch": "microsoft.cognitiveservices/accounts--ModelRequests",
              "formatter": 1,
              "formatOptions": {
                "aggregation": "Sum"
              }
            },
            {
              "columnMatch": "microsoft.cognitiveservices/accounts--ModelRequests Timeline",
              "formatter": 5
            }
          ],
          "labelSettings": [
            {
              "columnId": "Subscription",
              "label": "Subscription / model / account"
            },
            {
              "columnId": "microsoft.cognitiveservices/accounts--InputTokens",
              "label": "Input tokens"
            },
            {
              "columnId": "microsoft.cognitiveservices/accounts--OutputTokens",
              "label": "Output tokens"
            },
            {
              "columnId": "microsoft.cognitiveservices/accounts--TotalTokens",
              "label": "Total tokens"
            },
            {
              "columnId": "microsoft.cognitiveservices/accounts--ModelRequests",
              "label": "Requests"
            }
          ],
          "rowLimit": 10000
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "name": "trend-label",
      "content": {
        "json": "### Account/deployment token trends (not subscription/model rollups)\nSeparate series retain resource identity and deployment names. Values are token totals within each chart interval, not per-minute capacity. No cross-account grouped sparklines are shown: native Sum sparklines can turn missing buckets into zero."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": 10,
      "name": "token-trend",
      "content": {
        "chartId": "model-fleet-token-trend",
        "version": "MetricsItem/2.0",
        "size": 0,
        "chartType": 2,
        "resourceIds": [
          "{FoundryResources}"
        ],
        "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
        "resourceType": "microsoft.cognitiveservices/accounts",
        "metrics": [
          {
            "namespace": "microsoft.cognitiveservices/accounts",
            "metric": "microsoft.cognitiveservices/accounts--TotalTokens",
            "aggregation": 1,
            "splitBy": "ModelDeploymentName",
            "splitByLimit": 1000
          }
        ],
        "title": "Account/deployment token trends"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "name": "request-trend-label",
      "content": {
        "json": "### Account/deployment request trends (not subscription/model rollups)\nSeparate resource/deployment series, summed within each interval, including failures. These are not combined subscription/model trends. Missing samples are not measured zero."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": 10,
      "name": "request-trend",
      "content": {
        "chartId": "model-fleet-request-trend",
        "version": "MetricsItem/2.0",
        "size": 0,
        "chartType": 2,
        "title": "Account/deployment request trends",
        "resourceIds": [
          "{FoundryResources}"
        ],
        "resourceType": "microsoft.cognitiveservices/accounts",
        "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
        "metrics": [
          {
            "namespace": "microsoft.cognitiveservices/accounts",
            "metric": "microsoft.cognitiveservices/accounts--ModelRequests",
            "aggregation": 1,
            "splitBy": "ModelDeploymentName",
            "splitByLimit": 1000
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "name": "detail-scope",
      "content": {
        "json": "### Detail account: {FoundryResource:name}\n`{FoundryResource}`\n\nARM summary tables below use this account only; native metric visuals compare all **Compare accounts** selections."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "name": "mix-label",
      "content": {
        "json": "### Detail account: tokens by deployment\nInput and output totals for **Detail account** only. Blank output means no reported output tokens; embeddings commonly report input only. For charges, use Azure Cost Analysis."
      }
    },
